Description:
 linuxmuster-webui7 - Next generation web-based management tool for linuxmuster.net v7.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-webui7 (7.4.10) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [lmn_linbo4] Fix KeyError 'diff' when saving an image without the
     diff option: default to False if missing from the POST body. Hide
     the edit button for images that are in an error state.
   * [lmn_users] Fix a duplicate "Login" column in the users list
     management view; replaced by the intended "Birthday" column.
     Fix #292.
   * [lmn_landingpage] Update landing page (index.html, po/pot, all
     locale .js) to display version 7.4. Merge pull request #290 from
     jolly-jump/patch-1.
   * [lmn_setup_wizard] Rebuild all.js.
